hildren":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"目次に戻る"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["起業とビジネス：全財産を失わないために"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"data-ad-dock-host":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"この章のヒント"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"失ってもよい金額のみで起業する：家財を投じず、借金をして開業しない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"会社への融資に対して個人保証に署名しない、配偶者も絶対に署名しない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"開業前に正しい主体を選ぶ：個人事業主と組合員は最後まで責任を負い、有限会社のみが「有限」となる"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"名義上の株主にならない、他人のために株式を保有（名義貸し）しない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"加盟前に商務部の備案を確認し、書面による開示を受け、契約書に「クーリングオフ期間」を明記する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"登録前に名称、営業所、経営範囲、登録資本金を確定させる。書類が揃っていればその場で免許を取得できる"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"許可証が必要な業種：許可が下りるまで営業禁止"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"食品販売はまず自分の区分を確認：製造・飲食は許可が必要、既包装の販売は届出のみ、生鮮肉・野菜は許可不要"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"袋詰め販売は「既包装食品」：ラベルの製造日、賞味期限、原材料名はすべて必須"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"一般食品で病気が治せると言うのは禁止：ラベル、説明書、広告、ライブ配信の台本すべてが対象"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"食品業界には刑事罰のラインがある：病死した肉や基準超過品を売れば罪に問われ、有害物質の混入は金額に関わらず、刑期は5年起算"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"営業許可取得後から申告義務が発生。収入がなくても期限内に「ゼロ申告」を行うこと（すべてゼロの書類を提出する）"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/ja/tip/12-13","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"請求書は実際の取引に基づいてのみ発行し、小規模納税者は免税枠を最大限活用する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"税務局を名乗り納税を催促してくるのはすべて詐欺です。納税手続きは電子税務局と 12366 を通じてのみ行ってください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"「手付金（定金）」と記載し「予約金（订金）」とは書かないこと。違約金は金額を明記し、支払猶予期間（売掛）は貸付として審査すること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"雇用後の最初の1ヶ月以内に書面契約を締結し、30 日以内に社会保険登録を行う"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"賃金は契約と法律に従って支払い、昇給、貸付、ボーナスはすべて書面で行う"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"販売してから製造：予約販売と小規模注文で需要を検証してから、製造に投資する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"サンプル完成後は、まず量産チェックリストを確認してから着手すること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"仕入れのたびに伝票と仕入れ元情報を保管すること。市場価格より明らかに低い仕入れ値のものは仕入れない：従業員が仕入れた偽物で、社長が判決を受けた事例"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"商品、パッケージ、タグ、宣伝画像に使用する図案は、自作するかライセンスを購入すること。色の変更やアイコンの追加は「改変」とはみなされない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"職務においては規定に従って行動し、規定外の善意はまず責任の所在を明確にすること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"損失が出たら手続きに従って退場を：簡便な注銷ができるなら注銷し、債務超過なら破産を。放置してはいけない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"ネットショップの運営代行、開店セミナー、 「無在庫販売」に手を出して費用を支払う前に、追加料金の有無と売上の出所を必ず確認すること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/12-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"中国で会社や個人事業を営むなら、毎年1月1日〜6月30日に前年の年次報告をオンライン提出。営業がなくても必要で、無料"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/12"},"children":["第12章"," ·"," ","起業とビジネス：全財産を失わないために"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"12-13"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["13"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["請求書は実際の取引に基づいてのみ発行し、小規模納税者は免税枠を最大限活用する"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["簡易課税制度を適用する小規模納税者で、月間の売上高が 10 万未満、かつ四半期の売上高が 30 万未満であれば、増値税（付加価値税）は免除されます。本来 3% で課税されるところ、同期間は 1% の税率に軽減されます。逆に、「コストを相殺するために他人名義の請求書を探す」行為は虚偽発行にあたり、初犯は 3 年以下の懲役、さらに 2 万から 20 万の罰金が科せられます。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。請求書を購入せず、請求書を販売せず、他人の「資金移動や請求書発行」の代行もしません。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["規模が小さく、簡易的な方法で納税する区分を「小規模納税者」と呼びます。法律には「売上高が起算点に達しない場合は、増値税（付加価値税）を免除する」と記載されています。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：請求書は実際の取引に基づいてのみ発行し、小規模納税者は免税枠を最大限活用する"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。請求書を購入せず、請求書を販売せず、他人の「資金移動や請求書発行」の代行もしません。実際に発生した取引に基づいて請求書を発行し、納税を行います。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["規模が小さく、簡易的な方法で納税する区分を「小規模納税者」と呼びます。法律には「売上高が起算点に達しない場合は、増値税（付加価値税）を免除する」と記載されています。この境界線のことを起算点と呼びます。2026年1月1日から2027年12月31日までの間、起算点は月単位では10万元、四半期単位では30万元、回数または日単位では1000元と計算され、このラインに達しなければ納税の必要はありません。同一期間内において、本来3%で納税すべきところが1%に軽減されますが、不動産の売買・賃貸および土地使用権の譲渡は除外されます。逆に、実態のない増値税専用発票（仕入税額控除用領収書）や、その他の税額控除に利用可能な発票を発行した場合は、3年以下の有期懲役または拘役、および2万から20万元の罰金に処されます。他人のために運転すること、自分で運転すること、他人に運転させること、または他人に運転を斡旋することも含まれます。税額が大きい場合は3年から10年の懲役。金額が多額な場合は10年以上の懲役または無期懲役（全国共通）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2024). 增值税法（2026 年 1 月 1 日施行，第二十三条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://fgk.chinatax.gov.cn/zcfgk/c100009/c5237365/content.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://fgk.chinatax.gov.cn/zcfgk/c100009/c5237365/content.html"]},"；财政部、税务总局 (2026). 关于增值税法施行后增值税优惠政策衔接事项的公告（财政部 税务总局公告 2026 年第 10 号，第一、二、六条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://fgk.chinatax.gov.cn/zcfgk/c102416/c5247434/content.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://fgk.chinatax.gov.cn/zcfgk/c102416/c5247434/content.html"]},"；全国人大 (1997). 刑法（第二百零五条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/201802/t20180206_364975.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/201802/t20180206_364975.shtml"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://fgk.chinatax.gov.cn/zcfgk/c100009/c5237365/content.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["増値税法は 2026 年 1 月 1 日より施行されます。従来の小規模納税者向けの2つの減免公告（2023 年第 19 号および 2023 年第 1 号）は、停止または廃止されました。金額の基準は変わりませんが、根拠となる規定が変更されたため、本条項は新しい文書に基づいて更新されています。刑法の原文は 1997 年版であり、第二百五条は後の修正案によって懲役刑の基準が調整されていますが、本条項では確認済みかつ変更されていない基準のみを記載しています。免除されるのは増値税であり、所得税は別途計算されます。「コストを相殺するために他人名義の請求書を探す」行為は虚偽発行であり、節税ではありません。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/12-12"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"営業許可取得後から申告義務が発生。収入がなくても期限内に「ゼロ申告」を行うこと（すべてゼロの書類を提出する）"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/12-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"税務局を名乗り納税を催促してくるのはすべて詐欺です。納税手続きは電子税務局と 12366 を通じてのみ行ってください"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"ro